<!-- @after 11. Further Reading :: recap -->
### Say these in the interview

- Treat a purchase token as evidence to verify on the backend, bound to one app account.
- Do not grant a pending purchase. Grant only after verified purchase state allows entitlement.
- Acknowledge new purchases within their deadline; renewals are not new acknowledgement tasks.
- RTDN is a prompt to query Play’s canonical state, not a complete entitlement record.
- Cancellation is not immediate expiry. Model grace, hold, pause and expiry separately.
